{"id":125700405216363,"name":"🦎Camo Or Snipe! 💥","desc":"LIMITED TIME CODE (x3 SPINS AND 500 CASH): BUGSFIXED\n\nCamo or Snipe is a game similar to hide & seek, but with a twist. Hiders camouflage themselves in their surroundings, while seekers use sniper rifles to track them down and eliminate them!\n\n🦎 Hiders: Blend into the environment to avoid being spotted by the snipers. If a hider is found, they will be eliminated.\n\n🔫 Snipers: Search for hiders who are camouflaged in the surroundings. Look for subtle hints of movement or any mistakes made by the hiders.\n\nTags: Sniper, FPS, Hide and Seek, Camo, Props","path":"/game/125700405216363-camo-or-snipe","slug":"125700405216363-camo-or-snipe","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7194be15e0865cd36d51de388f3e35cbb63d7886ec453f36a4b59888d5e88950.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-44a3ca41d1db85f165e572c48ad25689/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":31981261,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-05T09:20:53.092Z","creator":{"name":"Camouflage INC","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69f9b6754e472212619d2489","title":"Croxyub Hub  ESP Movement Mobile","game":{"_id":"69eed6aae682a333a7c226bf","gameId":125700405216363,"name":"🦎Camo Or Snipe! 💥","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2c54a82d4b8eebac08743bc8259fc42aa6d8b360708ad2b4dc4bf1701980a2ad.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-5097816ecc433e8910d48b820c4201e1-1155a1ec5328.png"},"slug":"125700405216363-camo-or-snipe","path":"/game/125700405216363-camo-or-snipe","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2c54a82d4b8eebac08743bc8259fc42aa6d8b360708ad2b4dc4bf1701980a2ad.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-5097816ecc433e8910d48b820c4201e1-1155a1ec5328.png"},"placeId":125700405216363},"slug":"Camo-Or-Snipe!-Croxyub-Hub-ESP-Movement-Mobile-212465","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":fa